---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Proposal One: Democratic Renewal and Citizen Stewardship"
  description="Ambitious structural reform draft requiring deep constitutional reform."
>
  <h1>Proposal One: Democratic Renewal and Citizen Stewardship</h1>
  <p>This is the ambitious proposal requiring deep constitutional reform.</p>
  <p class="callout"><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> This is a discussion draft, not legal advice, not a finished constitutional document, and not a claim that these changes are politically easy.</p>

  <div class="btn-row">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/assets/pdfs/democratic-renewal-full-proposal.pdf" download>
      Download Proposal One (PDF)
    </a>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <iframe class="pdf-viewer" title="Proposal One PDF" src="/assets/pdfs/democratic-renewal-full-proposal.pdf"></iframe>
    <p>If your browser cannot display the PDF, use the download button above or <a href="/assets/pdfs/democratic-renewal-full-proposal.pdf" download>download it directly here</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h2>What this proposal attempts to do</h2>
      <p>It aims to redesign democratic guardrails so public authority is easier to audit and harder to capture.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>Why this proposal is difficult</h2>
      <p>Its scope is broad, and the legal and political path is hard. It needs deep disagreement, revision, and serious constitutional-level analysis.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h2>How to comment</h2>
      <p>Use GitHub Discussions once configured, or send critique by email to contact@citizenstewardship.org.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section placeholder">
    <h3>Giscus Comments Placeholder (Proposal One)</h3>
    <p>Comments are not active yet. Replace this placeholder with the generated Giscus script after Discussions is configured.</p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
